WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.433
Make ten

2
00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:11.367
It is Adey Abeba season! Filling a ten makes big additions easy.

3
00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:15.500
Eight plus five.

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:19.933
Move two over to fill the ten.

5
00:00:19.933 --> 00:00:23.867
Ten and three is thirteen.
